{"id":"164f10d6a348b7a4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/10_named_equations.md","title":"命名 λ 与开放等式假设","display":"命名 λ 与开放等式假设","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","specification"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>specification</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"1.-语法与名字\">1. 语法与名字</h2>\n<p>NVar、NLam、NApp 使用独立标签。NRaw 是自然数名上的有限项集合谓词，NTermSet 给出其确切集合。NFree 不计绑定名；NName 计全部名字。NEncode 的最近绑定优先，未绑定名保持为可恢复的自由名编码。NAlpha 由空栈下编码相等定义。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ba5bcae5363217b\" href=\"?note=5ba5bcae5363217b\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NRaw\">NRaw</a></td>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e2a9b89b978fc779\" href=\"?note=e2a9b89b978fc779\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NTermSet\">NTermSet</a></td>\n<td><code>T</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d7a1e6d5f52b38db\" href=\"?note=d7a1e6d5f52b38db\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFree\">NFree</a></td>\n<td><code>x, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97d55dcf5ea1bb3d\" href=\"?note=97d55dcf5ea1bb3d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NName\">NName</a></td>\n<td><code>x, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6fdefd03771be4\" href=\"?note=0a6fdefd03771be4\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFirst\">NFirst</a></td>\n<td><code>g, x, i</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e29e39c5492f7b19\" href=\"?note=e29e39c5492f7b19\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NEncode\">NEncode</a></td>\n<td><code>g, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e530de2f67510985\" href=\"?note=e530de2f67510985\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NAlpha\">NAlpha</a></td>\n<td><code>t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6a611d8e49980c6f\" href=\"?note=6a611d8e49980c6f\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFresh\">NFresh</a></td>\n<td><code>x, s, t, z</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9c2eed29b5aacecb\" href=\"?note=9c2eed29b5aacecb\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NSub\">NSub</a></td>\n<td><code>x, s, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fc42dec2e07c42c4\" href=\"?note=fc42dec2e07c42c4\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NContext\">NContext</a></td>\n<td><code>c</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5beb47cd93dd9865\" href=\"?note=5beb47cd93dd9865\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NPlug\">NPlug</a></td>\n<td><code>c, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>NSub 的冲突分支选避开源项/插入项全部名字的新名，先改名再继续替换。选“全部名字”是保守约定，<strong>不能据此断言所有只以 FV 选新名的递归捕获避免算法都有错</strong>；是否正确必须检查该算法递归改名的实际定义。NPlug 则是原样填孔，允许上下文的绑定捕获插入项自由名，与 NSub 不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-三种开放等式理论\">2. 三种开放等式理论</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"2e430f284172300e\" href=\"?note=2e430f284172300e\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NMode\">NMode</a></td>\n<td><code>r</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"db9c3028662cd4b5\" href=\"?note=db9c3028662cd4b5\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NAx\">NAx</a></td>\n<td><code>r, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"627569382a44bdf5\" href=\"?note=627569382a44bdf5\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NEqs\">NEqs</a></td>\n<td><code>g</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"cab78b4b2a2a4b31\" href=\"?note=cab78b4b2a2a4b31\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NDer\">NDer</a></td>\n<td><code>r, g, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"c8ea853d3be8cf1e\" href=\"?note=c8ea853d3be8cf1e\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NProof\">NProof</a></td>\n<td><code>r, g, p, e</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"97d156dcd64ca2fd\" href=\"?note=97d156dcd64ca2fd\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NProv\">NProv</a></td>\n<td><code>r, g, e</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"888d885c3585f2c1\" href=\"?note=888d885c3585f2c1\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NCongruence\">NCongruence</a></td>\n<td><code>r, R</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"877a0a4748396497\" href=\"?note=877a0a4748396497\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NConseq\">NConseq</a></td>\n<td><code>r, g, e</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>模式 0 只有 α；模式 1 加根 β；模式 2 加 β、η，η 有不自由出现条件。g 是等式对的集合。NDer 的规则为假设、选定基本等式、对称、传递与一孔上下文同余。证书是有限记录列，不能凭等式在语义中成立任意插入。</p>\n<p>语义量化固定 NTermSet 平方内的等价同余关系 R，要求包含模式公理和 Γ。这给开放假设一个真实的集合大小同余语义，而非删去 Γ 后声称类型相同或代码相等就是完整证明论。</p>\n<p>书面对应该语义的论证：有限推导在每个相应同余中成立；反向令 RΓ 是“从 Γ 可有限导出”的等式关系。它是固定平方内的分离子集，含 Γ/公理，且由规则闭合为等价同余。将语义量词实例化于 RΓ 得到句法导出。该证明说明方向与集合界，完整内核化仍待完成。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-语法与名字","text":"1. 语法与名字","level":2},{"id":"2.-三种开放等式理论","text":"2. 三种开放等式理论","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NRaw","status":"resolved","id":"5ba5bcae5363217b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NTermSet","status":"resolved","id":"e2a9b89b978fc779","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NTermSet|NTermSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFree","status":"resolved","id":"d7a1e6d5f52b38db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFree|NFree]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NName","status":"resolved","id":"97d55dcf5ea1bb3d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NName|NName]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFirst","status":"resolved","id":"0a6fdefd03771be4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFirst|NFirst]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NEncode","status":"resolved","id":"e29e39c5492f7b19","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NEncode|NEncode]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NAlpha","status":"resolved","id":"e530de2f67510985","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NAlpha|NAlpha]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFresh","status":"resolved","id":"6a611d8e49980c6f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NFresh|NFresh]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NSub","status":"resolved","id":"9c2eed29b5aacecb","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NSub|NSub]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NContext","status":"resolved","id":"fc42dec2e07c42c4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NContext|NContext]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NPlug","status":"resolved","id":"5beb47cd93dd9865","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与名字","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NPlug|NPlug]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NMode","status":"resolved","id":"2e430f284172300e","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"2. 三种开放等式理论","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NMode|NMode]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NAx","status":"resolved","id":"db9c3028662cd4b5","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnc